//   Per SysV psABI § A.4:struct ≤16 bytes → INTEGER class (passed in 1-2 regs).
//   target=amd64_sysv path abi_sysv_classify_arg returns CLASS_INTEGER
//   → emit_call put both fields into %rdi (single 8-byte reg per SysV § 3.2.3).
